Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducable in 4.3.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable unknown - Arch Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Thu, 02 Jan 2025 22:52:26 +0000 - X11 - Vulkan (Mobile) - integrated Intel(R) UHD Graphics (JSL) - Intel(R) Pentium(R) Silver N6000 @ 1.10GHz (4 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\n```gdscript\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n    print(ProjectSettings.get_setting(\"application/game_settings/server_ip\"))\n    print(Os.has_feature(\"client_build\"))\n```\nwill print `127.0.0.1` despite the `client_build` feature being enabled and should therefore print `provide-interest.gl.at.ply.gg`\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5384a143-fa21-46c5-a91b-77a7ae23dcd3)\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. make a prject setting using advanced mode\n2. make a export with some kind unique feature flag\n3. make a override of the custom property in step 1 with the flag made in step 2\n4. project settings is not overwritten when ran via the exported build\n\naccording to the docs (or atleast how I read it) this should be automatically done?\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/export/feature_tags.html#overriding-project-settings\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[new-game-project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18327019/new-game-project.zip)\ncontains a linux export with test_feature.","closed_by":{"login":"walksanatora","id":47339836,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MzM5ODM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47339836?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/walksanatora","html_url":"https://github.com/walksanatora","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walksanatora/followers","followi